N: Grandparents' comments:
N: This dance celebrates the arrival of Alexander Hung Vy Pham Roodman,
N: son of Mai Pham and David Roodman and brother of Benjamin at 5:00pm
N: on December 31, 20002.  Within an hour or so after Alexander's birth,
N: David had pictures of our new grandson up on the web for us all to
N: see and admire.  He is beautiful.
